    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog Bard is a short, poetic experience about finding inspiration in the world around you. Explore a simple forest and perform reflective ballads as you travel from inn to inn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through a procedurally generated forest to find sparks of inspiration. Select thoughtful themes for your songs to perform at an inn. Break even and continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Please note that Frog Bard is a short (5-10 minutes) but re-playable experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features an original song played on a guitar that was now\u00a0modified so\u00a0we'll\u00a0never\u00a0hear\u00a0that guitar\u00a0play\u00a0this song\u00a0again!!!</p>",
